<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei";
            color: #111;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .placeholder {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            width: 250px;
        }
        .logo-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            width: 200px;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }
        .title-container {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .main-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .sub-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Main Content Grid */
        .main-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: stretch;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* Left Column */
        .col-left {
            width: 28%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .guidelines {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .guidelines li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .icon-ph {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            background-color: #4a86e8;
            margin-right: 8px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* Center Column */
        .col-center {
            width: 38%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Right Column */
        .col-right {
            width: 34%;
        }
        .right-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .right-table th {
            font-size: 18px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .right-table td {
            padding: 4px 0;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .right-table .td-label {
            text-align: right;
            padding-right: 15px;
            width: 30%;
        }
        .right-table .td-val {
            text-align: center;
            width: 35%;
        }
        .dash-line {
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #ccc;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #c4a771; /* approximate color from image */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-left">
                <div class="placeholder" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%;">[Logo: CNS]</div>
                <div>
                    <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32; letter-spacing: 1px;">中国营养学会</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #2e7d32;">Chinese Nutrition Society</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="title-container">
                <h1 class="main-title">中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</h1>
                <div class="sub-title">依据《中国居民膳食指南(2022)》绘制</div>
            </div>

            <div class="logo-right">
                <div class="placeholder" style="width: 45px; height: 45px;">[Logo: MCNC]</div>
                <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3; color: #0d47a1;">
                    <div>MCNC-CNS</div>
                    <div>中国营养学会</div>
                    <div>妇幼营养分会</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Layout -->
        <div class="main-content">
            <!-- Left Column -->
            <div class="col-left">
                <ul class="guidelines">
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>继续母乳喂养</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>满6月龄开始添加辅食</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>从肉/肝泥、铁强化谷粉等糊状食物开始</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>母乳或奶类充足时不需补钙</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>仍需要补充维生素D, 400IU/d</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>回应式喂养，鼓励逐步自主进食</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>逐步过渡到多样化膳食</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>辅食不加或少加盐、糖和调味品</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>定期测量体重和身长</li>
                    <li><span class="icon-ph"></span>饮食卫生、进食安全</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="placeholder" style="width: 80%; height: 280px; margin: 25px auto 0 auto;">[Illustration: Baby in high chair eating]</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Center Column -->
            <div class="col-center">
                <div class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 480px;">[Diagram: Dietary Pagoda]</div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #999; padding: 15px 30px; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                    中国营养学会指导<br>
                    中国营养学会妇幼营养分会编制
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column -->
            <div class="col-right">
                <table class="right-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th></th>
                            <th>7~12月龄</th>
                            <th>13~24月龄</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label">盐</td>
                            <td class="td-val">不建议额外添加</td>
                            <td class="td-val">0-1.5克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label">油</td>
                            <td class="td-val">0-10克</td>
                            <td class="td-val">5-15克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr><td colspan="3"><div class="dash-line"></div></td></tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label" style="padding-top: 8px;">蛋类</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 8px;">15-50克<br><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;">(至少1个鸡蛋黄)</span></td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 8px;">25-50克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label" style="padding-top: 10px;">畜禽肉鱼类</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 10px;">25-75克</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 10px;">50-75克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr><td colspan="3"><div class="dash-line"></div></td></tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label" style="padding-top: 8px;">蔬菜类</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 8px;">25-100克</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 8px;">50-150克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label">水果类</td>
                            <td class="td-val">25-100克</td>
                            <td class="td-val">50-150克</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr><td colspan="3"><div class="dash-line"></div></td></tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; padding: 15px 0 8px 0;">继续母乳喂养，逐步过渡到谷类为主食</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td></td>
                            <td class="td-val">母乳700-500毫升</td>
                            <td class="td-val">母乳600-400毫升</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="td-label" style="padding-top: 10px;">谷类</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 10px;">20-75克</td>
                            <td class="td-val" style="padding-top: 10px;">50-100克</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #555; text-align: right; margin-top: 25px; padding-right: 5px;">
                    不满6月龄添加辅食，须咨询专业人员做出决定
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div style="flex: 1;">V2022-2.00</div>
            <div style="flex: 2; text-align: center;">妇幼营养分会网站 www.mcnutri.cn 图像文件下载</div>
            <div style="flex: 1;"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
